  VNet: VNET-PROD-01
  VNet: VNET-PROD-02

Processing Subscription: Development [yyyyyyyy-yyyy-yyyy-yyyy-yyyyyyyyyyyy]
  VNet: VNET-DEV-01

VNET inventory completed.
Output file: .\Azure-VNET-Inventory.csv

